        "description": "<p>Snakes receive a +8 species bonus on @Check[skill:balance]{Balance check}s and a +4 species bonus on Hide, Listen, and @Check[skill:spot]{Spot check}s. Snakes apply either their Strength or Dexterity modifier, whichever is higher, to @Check[skill:climb]{Climb check}s.</p>",
        "source": "d20 Modern SRD",
